sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant SES as DocumentSession
    participant SI as MarkdownIndex
    participant PM as PreviewManager
    participant WB as IsolatedPreview
    User->>PM: 打开预览
    PM->>SES: snapshot(content,version)
    PM->>SI: 解析或读取最新有效索引
    SI-->>PM: block nodes + source spans
    PM->>PM: sanitize HTML/CSP/resource policy
    PM->>WB: lazy init + render(version)
    opt 出现 Mermaid 且用户启用图表显示
      WB->>WB: load bundled Mermaid in isolated document
    end
    SES-->>PM: dirtyRanges(version+1)
    PM->>PM: debounce + cancel stale job
    PM->>WB: patch changed blocks(if same session)
    User->>PM: 关闭预览
    PM->>WB: dispose and release resources
